# Precise Redaction: "Counter target white or black spell." On turn 3 Bot1 casts Brainstorm (blue) and Lightning Bolt (red):
# neither can be targeted (the refusals). Vindicate, white and black at once, can: a spell is "white or black" if it is
# either color or both, so it is countered, and Bot2 loses no permanent. The Bolt still resolves for 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Brainstorm
Lightning Bolt
Vindicate
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Precise Redaction
Island x12

